<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Goofa</book>
  <para style="h">1Qoronttoosa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Qoro</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Qoronttoosa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosi Qoronttoosa Asaas Xaafida Koyro Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosi Qoronttoosa Asaas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafida Koyro Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi Qoronttoosa asaas xaafida koyro kiitay xaafettiday, Phawuloosi Qoronttoosan essida woosa keethan ammaniyaa asaa de7oninne ammano bolla denddida metuwas zaaro immanaassa. He wode Qoronttoosa katamay biittan de7iya dumma dumma asay de7iya Girike katamanne Akkaya giya Roome awurajjaas waanna katama. He katamay zal77en erettida, wogan minnida, dumma dumma iita de7on dalggidayssanne haymaanote darotethan erettidayssa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaarey minthidi odanaw koyiday, he woosa keethaa giddon medhettida shaahotethabaa, dumma dumma iita de7obaa, laymatethabaa, eko gelobaa, woosa keethaa wogabaa, Geeshsha Ayyaana imotatabaanne hayqoppe denddobaa. Wonggelay ha oyshata waati zaariyakko hawaarey naagidi odees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Siiqoy Xoossay ba asaas immida aadho imota gideyssa shemppo tammanne heedzay qonccisees; qassi shemppo tammanne heedzay ha maxaafan daro erettida kifile geetettidi erettees.</para>
  <para style="iot">1Qoronttoosa kiitaa ayfe qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo qofaa 1:1-9</para>
  <para style="io1">Ammaniya asaa giddon medhettida shaaketethaa 1:9-4:21</para>
  <para style="io1">Laymatethinne soo asaa de7o wogaa 5:1-7:40</para>
  <para style="io1">Ammaniya asaanne ammanonna asaa 8:1-11:1</para>
  <para style="io1">Woosa keethinne goynno wogaa 11:2-14:40</para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa dendduwanne ammaniyaa asaa dendduwa 15:1-58</para>
  <para style="io1">Yihudan de7iya metootettida ammaniyaa asaas maado 16:1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">Kuushsha qofaa 16:5-24</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Xoossaa sheniyan Yesuus Kiristtoosa hawaare gidanaw xeegettida Phawuloosinne, nu ishaa Sostenisi, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Qoronttoosan de7iya Xoossaa woosa keethaas, Yesuus Kiristtoosan geeyidayssatasinne geeshshi gidana mela xeegettidayssatas; qassi enttasinne nuus Goda gidiya nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthaa ubba bessan xeegiya ubbaas;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:1">Ha@O 18:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Xoossay, nu Aawaynne Goday Yesuus Kiristtoosi hinttew aadho keehatethaanne sarotethaa immo.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Xoossaa galatees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Xoossay Kiristtoos Yesuusa baggara hinttew immida aadho keehatethaa gisho, taani ubba wode Xoossaa galatays. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Iyan odaninne eratetha ubban hintte durettideta. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Taani Kiristtoosabaa markkattidayssi tuma gideyssa hessi qonccisees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, hintte nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa yuussaa naagishe de7ishin, ay ayyaana imoykka hinttew paccenna. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosi simmiya wode hintte borettonnayssata gidana mela I wurssethi gakkanaw hinttena miinthana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ba Na7aa, nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosara issifetethay daana mela hinttena xeegida Xoossay ammanettidayssa.</para>
  <para style="s">Woosa keethan de7iya shaahuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ta ishato, hintte gidon shaaketethi doonnaada hintte issi wozananinne issi qofan issino gididi, daana mela nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthan ta hinttena woossays. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta ishato, Qelo7e soo asay hintte giddon ooshshi de7eyssa taw odidosona. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hinttefe issoti issoti, “Taani Phawuloosassa; taani Aphiloosassa; taani Phexiroosassa; taani Kiristtoosassa” yaageeta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:24">Ha@O 18:24</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi shaakettideyye? Hintte gisho, masqaliya bolla kaqettiday Phawulooseyye? Woykko hintte Phawuloosa sunthan xammaqettidetiyye?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Taani Qarisphoosinne Gaayoosi attin hinttefe oonakka xammaqaboonna gisho, Xoossaa galatays.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:8">Ha@O 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:29">Ha@O 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Roome 16:23</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, oonikka hinttena ta sunthan xammaqettideta gaanaw dandda7enna. [ <verse number="16" style="v"/>Qassi Isxifaanose soo asaakka ta xammaqidayssa akeekays, shin haraa oona xammaqidaakko hassayikke.] <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:15">1Qoro 16:15</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi tana kiittiday Wonggelaa odana melassafe attin xammaqana mela gidenna. Kiristtoosi masqaliya bolla hayqqidayssi hada gidonna mela taani asa cinccatetha qaalan odikke.</para>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosi Xoossaa wolqqaanne cinccatethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi masqaliya bolla hayqqidayssa odiya qaalay dhayeyssatas eeyatethi, shin nuus atteyssatas Xoossaa wolqqaa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Taani cinccata cinccatethaa dhayssana;</para>
  <para style="q2">akeekanchchota akeekaa balethana”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:14">Isa 29:14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yaatin, cincci awun de7ii? Higge asttamaarey awun de7ii? Woykko ha sa7aa eranchchoy awun de7ii? Xoossay ha sa7aa cinccatethaa eeyatethi oothibeennee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:17">Iyo 12:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 19:12">Isa 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 33:18">33:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:25">44:25</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ha sa7aa asay bantta cinccatethan Xoossaa eronna mela ba cinccatethan diggidi, eeyatethan taybettiya, nuuni odiya qaalan ammaneyssata ashshanaw Xoossaa shene gidis. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ayhudeti malaata be7anaw koyoosona; qassi Giriketi cinccatethi koyoosona. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Shin nuuni masqale bolla kaqettida Kiristtoosa sabbakoos. Hessi Ayhudatas dhube; qassi Giriketas eeyatethi. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Shin Xoossay xeegidayssatas, Ayhude gidin, Girike gidin Kiristtoosi Xoossaa wolqqaanne iya cinccatethaa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Xoossaa eeyatethay asa cinccatethafe aadhdhees; qassi Xoossaa daaburay asa minotethafe minnees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hiza, ta ishato, Xoossay hinttena xeegiya wode hintte ay mela aseekko qoppite. Asa qofan hintte giddon cinccati, wolqqaamatinne dhoqqa zareti dookkona. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Shin Xoossay cinccata yeellayanaw alamen de7iya eeyata dooris; qassi minota yeellayanaw alamen de7iya daaburanchchota dooris. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Xoossay ha alamiyan gita geetettidabaa dhayssanaw, ha sa7aa kawushshabaa, kadhettidabaanne pathonnabaa dooris. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Oonikka Xoossaa sinthan ceeqqettonna mela hessa oothis. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Shin Xoossay hinttew Kiristtoos Yesuusara issifetethi daana mela oothis. I nuus Xoossaafe cinccatethi, xillotethi, geeshshatethinne atotethi gidis. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Ceeqettiya oonikka Godan ceeqqo” yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Er 9:24</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosa kaqetethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta ishato, taani koyro Xoossaa qaala hinttew odashe yida wode, doona bilatethaninne cinccatethan yabiikke. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Taani hinttera de7iya wode masqaliya bolla kaqettida Yesuus Kiristtoosappe attin harabaa eranaw koyikke gada ta qofa qachchas. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ta hinttera de7iya wode daaburan, yashshaninne daro kokkorssan de7as.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:9">Ha@O 18:9</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ta kiitaynne ta timirttey doona bilatethaninne cinccatethan gidonnashin, Geeshsha Ayyaana wolqqaa qonccisethaana. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessika, hintte ammanoy Xoossaa wolqqaanappe attin asa cinccatethan zempponna melassa.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoossaa cinccatethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ayyaanan de7on diccidayssatas nuuni cinccatethaa qaalan odoos. Shin he cinccatethay, ha sa7aa cinccatethaa woykko dhayanaw de7iya ha sa7aa haareyssata cinccatethaa gidenna. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Shin nuuni odiya cinccetethay, daro wodeppe sinthe Xoossay nu bonchchuwas giigisidayssanne geemmidi de7iya xuura cinccatethaa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ha sa7aa haareyssatappe oonikka ha cinccatethaa eribeenna. Entti eridabaa gidiyakko, bonchcho Godaa masqaliya bolla kaqqokona. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Shin Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ayfey be7iboonnabaa,</para>
  <para style="q1">haythi si7iboonnabaa,</para>
  <para style="q1">wozani qoppiboonabaa,</para>
  <para style="q2">Xoossay bana siiqeyssatas giigisis” yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 64:4">Isa 64:4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Xoossay ba xuuraa ba Ayyaana baggara nuus qonccisis. Geeshsha Ayyaanay hari attoshin geemmida Xoossaa xuura ubbaa pilggees. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Asan de7iya asa ayyaanaappe attin asabaa oonikka erenna. Hessadakka, Xoossabaa Xoossaa Ayyaanaappe attin oonikka erenna. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Xoossay nuus coo immidabaa nu erana mela Xoossaa Ayyaanaa ekkidappe attin ha sa7aa ayyaana ekkibookko.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nuuni ayyaanabaa, ayyaana asatas asa cinccatethan gidonnashin, Xoossaa Ayyaanay immiya cinccatethan tamaarssos. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shin Geeshsha Ayyaanay baynna asi Xoossaa Ayyaana imotata ekkenna. Hessi iyaw eeyatethi; ubbay Geeshsha Ayyaanan pilggettiya gisho, I eranaw dandda7enna. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shin Geeshsha Ayyaani de7iya asi ubbabaa pilggees, shin iya oonikka pilggenna. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Godaa wozanaa erey oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2">Iya zoranaw dandda7ey oonee?”</para>
  <para style="m">geetettidi xaafettidayssa mela. Shin nuus Kiristtoosa wozani de7ees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Isa 40:13</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xoossaa oosanchchota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta ishato, hintte Kiristtoosan buroo yooganne ammanonna asaatho de7iya gisho, taani ayyaanabaa hinttew odanaw dandda7abiikke. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hintte mino kathi maanaw dandda7iboonna gisho, taani hinttena maathi paahas; ha77ika dandda7ibeekketa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 5:12-13">Ib 5:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ha77ika hintte ammanonna asada de7eeta. Hintte giddon de7iya qanaateynne palamay hintte ammanonna asada de7eyssa erisenne? Hintte ammanonna asada haneeta. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hinttefe issoy, “Taani Phawuloosassa” haray qassi, “Taani Aphiloosassa” giikko, ammanonna asa mela gidekketii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:12">1Qoro 1:12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yaatin, Aphiloosi oonee? Phawuloosi oonee? Nuuni hinttena ammanthida Xoossaa oosaanchchota. Xoossay issuwas issuwas immida oosuwa mela oothiya oosanchchota gidokkonaayye? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ta tokkas; Aphiloosi haathe ushshis, shin dichchey Xoossaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:4-11">Ha@O 18:4-11</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 18:24-28">24-28</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, dichchida Xoossaafe attin tokkayka haathe ushsheyka aykkoka gidenna. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Tokkeynne haathe ushshey woli mela, shin issoy issoy ba oosuwa mela Xoossay immiya woytuwa ekkana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nuuni issife Xoossaas oothiya iya oosanchchota gidiya gisho, hintte Xoossaa shooqa; Xoossaa keethi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Xoossay taw immida aadho keehatethaa mela hiillanchcho anaaxeda baasuwa yeggas. Hara uray iya bolla keexes. Shin iya bolla keexiya oonikka waattidi keexiyako, baw naagetto. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Issi toho yegettida baasuwappe hara baaso yegganaw oonikka dandda7enna. He baasoykka Yesuus Kiristtoosa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Shin ha baasuwa bolla oonikka worqqan woykko biran gidin, al77o shuchchan woykko mithan gidin, maatan woykko maqan keexiko, <verse number="13" style="v"/>issi issi asi he baasuwa bolla aybin keexidaakko pirdda gallas taman paacettidi qonccana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Oonikka he baasuwa bolla keexida keethay taman xuugettonna attiko, ba woytuwa ekkana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shin oode oosoykka taman xuugetiko, he uraas woytoy baawa. Gidoshin, I ba huu7en tamappe kessi ekkida asada attana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hintte Xoossaa keethi gideyssanne Xoossaa Ayyaanay hinttenan de7eyssa erekketii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:19">1Qoro 6:19</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:16">2Qoro 6:16</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Oonikka Xoossaa keethi laallikko, Xoossaykka iya laallana. Xoossaa keethay geeshshi; he keethayka hinttena.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Oonikka bana cimmofo. Ha sa7aa cinccatethan bana cincca oothidi ekkiya oonikka Xoossaa sinthan cincca gidanaw eeya gido. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ha sa7aa cinccatethay Xoossaa sinthan eeyatethi. Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Xoossay cinccata entta gene qofan oykkees” yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:13">Iyo 5:13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Qassi, “Cinccata qofay maaddonnabaa gideyssa Goday erees” yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 94:11">Maz 94:11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ubbay hinttessa gidiya gisho, oonikka asan ceeqettofo. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Phawuloosi, Aphiloosinne Phexiroosi, ha alamey, de7oy, hayqoy, ha77i de7ey, sinthafe yaanayssi, ubbay hinttessa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hintte Kiristtoosassa; Kiristtoosikka Xoossassa.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosa hawaareta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Asay nuna Kiristtoosa aylledanne Xoossaa xuuraa qonccisanaw hadari imettida asada oothidi qoppo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>He hadaraa ekkida asati bantta Godaas ammanettidayssata gidanaw bessees. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Shin hintte woykko haray tana pirddiko, taw aykkoka gidenna. Haray atto, takka ta bolla pirddike. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ta kahay geeshshi, shin hessi ta polo xillo gideyssa bessenna. Ta bolla pirddanay Godaa xalaala. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, wodey gakkonna, Goday yoonna oode bollaka pirddofite. I dhuman geemmidabaa poo7o kessenna; asa wozanan qosettida qofa qonccisana. He wode, issoy issoy Xoossaafe galataa ekkana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ta ishato, hintte gisho, Aphiloosanne tana leemiso oothada hinttew odas. Hessa ta oothiday, “Xaafettidayssafe aadhdhofa” yaagiya zoriya hintte nuuppe tamaarana melassa. Hessa gisho, oonikka issuwa sabbidi hankkuwa kadhanaw bessenna. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ne haratappe aybin aadhdhay? Neeni ekkaboonnabay aybi de7ii? Yaatin, neeni ekkidabaa hara asappe ekkida gidikko, ekkiboonna asada ays ceqettay?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ha77i hintte kallideta. Ha77i hintte durettideta. Nuuni baynna hintte xalaala kawotideta. Hintte tuma kawotidabaa gidiyakko, nukka hinttera kawotanashin. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Xoossay nuna hawaareta, hayqo pirddettida asada asa ubbaafe nuna guye aathida taw daanees. Nuuni ha alamiyas, kiitanchchotasinne asaas kaassaba gidida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nuuni Kiristtoosa gisho eeya gidida, shin hintte Kiristtoosan cinccata gidideta. Nuuni daaburanchcho, shin hintte mino gidideta. Hintte bonchchettideta, shin nuuni tooshettida. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ha77i gakkanaw nu koshattoos, saamottoos, kallottoos, wadhettoos; daana soo dhayidi toylattoos. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nuuni nu kushen oothi aqoos. Nuna asi baaddiya wode anjjoos; nuna gooddiya wode dandda7os.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:3">Ha@O 18:3</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nu bolla iitabaa odettiya wode lo77o qaala zaaroos. Nu ha77i gakkanaw ha alamiya pitonne wora yegettiya buure gidida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Taani hessa xaafiday, ta siiqiya naytada, hinttena zoranaw xaafasippe attin yeellayanaw gidenna. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kiristtoosan hinttena dichchiya tayboppe bolla gidida kaaletheyssati de7ikkoka, hinttew issi aawu de7ees. Ta hinttena Kiristtoos Yesuusa Wonggelaan yelas. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hiza, hintte tana leemiso oothidi kaallana mela hinttena woossays.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:1">1Qoro 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:17">Fil 3:17</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ammanettida, ta siiqiya, Godan ta na7aa, Ximotiyoosa hintteko kiittas. I dumma dumma bessan de7iya woosa keethan ta tamaarssida, Kiristtoosa Yesuusan de7iya ta ogiya hinttena hassayisana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Taani hintteko yoonnabaa daanin, otoriya issi issi asati de7oosona. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Shin Goday giikko, mata wode taani hintteko baana. He wode otoranchchota odaa xalaala gidonnashin, entta wolqqaaka erana. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Xoossaa kawotethay oda gidonnashin, wolqqaa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Taani hintteko xam77ara booyye woykko siiqoranne ashkke ayyaanara bo? Awussa dooreti?</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ammaniya asa giddon de7iya yeellayiya ooso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hintte giddon laymatethi de7eyssi zigirettees. Hessa mela laymatethi hari attoshin, ammanonna asaykka oothokona. Hintte giddon ba aawa machcheera tunida asi de7ees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Zaare 22:30</char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hessan hintte qiirottanawunne yeellatanaw bessennee shin, otorttideta. Hessa mela borssobaa oothida uraa hintte giddofe kessanaw bessennee?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Taani ashon hinttera doona ixxikokka ayyaanan ta hinttera de7ays. Taani hinttera de7iya asada hanada hessa mela oosuwa oothida uraa bolla pirddas. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthan hintte shiiqiya wode taani ayyaanan hinttera daana. Hessan Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa wolqqay hinttera gidana. <verse number="5" style="v"/>He uraa nagara ashoy <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nagara ashoy: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nagara medhoy woykko nagara asatethay.</char></note> dhayidi, iya ayyaanay Godaa Yesuusa pirdda gallasan attana mela I Xalahes aadhdhi imetto.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hintte ceeqoy lo77o gidenna. Guutha irshshoy munuqa ubbaa dentheyssa erekketiyye?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:9">Gala 5:9</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hintte ha77i irshshoy baynna munuqa gidana mela, nagara irshshuwaa hinttefe kessite. Nu Faasika dorssaa gidida Kiristtoosi yarshshettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:5">Kessa 12:5</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hessi gisho, geneynne iitatethi de7iya irshshuwaara gidonnashin, tumatethinne geeshshatethi de7iya uythara nu baaliya bonchchoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:7">Kessa 13:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:3">Zaare 16:3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ta kase xaafida dabddaabbiyan hintte laymatiya asaara gayttonna mela hinttew odas. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessa guussay ha alamiyan de7iya laymateyssatara woykko uuzetara woykko kaysotara woykko eeqa goynneyssatara polo gayttofite guussu gidenna. Hessa gidikko, ha alamiyappe hintte keyanaw bessees shin attis. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Shin ammanays yaagishe laymateyssatara woykko uuzetara woykko eeqa goynneyssatara woykko cayeyssatara woykko mathotteyssatara woykko kaysotara gayttofite gada hinttew odays. Hessa mela asara hari attoshin, kathika mooppite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Woosa keethafe karera de7eyssata bolla pirddanaw tana aybe gathey? Woosa keethan de7eyssata bolla hintte pirddeketiyye? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shin karera de7eyssata bolla Xoossay pirddana. He iitabaa oothiya uraa hintte giddofe kessite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:5">Zaare 13:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17:7">17:7</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ammaniya asaa giddon de7iya mooto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hintte giddofe issoy issuwara mootoy de7ikko, hessa ammaniyaa asaa sinthan pirddettanayssa aggidi ammanonna asa sinthan pirddettanaw waanidi bii? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Geeshshati alamiya bolla pirddanayssa hintte erekketii? Yaatin, hintte alamiya bolla pirddiyabaa gidikko, hayssa mela guuthabaa pirddanaw waanidi dandda7ekketii? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nuuni kiitanchchota bolla pirddanayssa erekketii? Yaatin, ha sa7a duussabaa bolla pirddanayssi hinttena waanidi xoonii? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yaatin, hessa mela metoy hintte giddon Medhettiko, woosa keetha ayfen kadhettida asaa sinthan pirddettanaw waati efeetii? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Taani hinttena yeellayanaw hessa gays. Hintte giddon kaccettida asata sigethanaw dandda7iya akeeka asi baawe? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yaatin, issi ammaneyssi hankko ammaneyssa pirdda keethan ammanonna asaa sinthan mootanaw bessii?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hiza, hintte issoy issuwa mootiyabaa gidikko hessi hintte kunddethaa bessees. Hessafe hintte qohettikonne cimettiko keehenne? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Shin hintte woli giddon ammaneyssati issoy issuwa qoheetanne cimmeeta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Geellati Xoossaa kawotethaa laattonayssa hintte erekketii? Hinttena cimmofite; laymateyssati woykko eeqa goynneyssati woykko qayxeyssati woykko addera addera gaytteyssati, <verse number="10" style="v"/>woykko kaysoti woykko uuzeti woykko mathotteyssati woykko cayeyssati woykko bonqeyssati Xoossaa kawotethaa laattokona. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hinttefe issi issi asati kase hessa mela. Shin hintte ha77i Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthaaninne Xoossaa Ayyaanan meecettideta; geeyideta; xillideta.</para>
  <para style="s">Hintte asatethan Xoossaa bonchchite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hintte, “Nu koyidabaa oothanaw dandda7os” yaageta. Shin ubbay hinttena maaddenna. Taani koyidabaa ubbaa oothanaw dandda7ays, shin aybikka tana haarenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:23">1Qoro 10:23</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hintte, “Kathi ulossa; uloykka kathassa” yaageta. Shin Xoossay uluwaka kathaaka dhayssanayssa ta hinttew odays. Nu asatethay Godaassafe attin laymatethassa gidenna. Godaykka nu asatethaassa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Xoossay Godaa hayqoppe denthidayssada, nunakka hayqoppe ba wolqqan denthana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hintte asatethay Kiristtoosa asatethaafe baggaa gideyssa erekketii? Yaatin, taani Kiristtoosa asatethaafe baggaa efada laymatetha bolla gidana mela ootho? Hanenna! <verse number="16" style="v"/>Laymatiya uray i gayttiya aseera issi asatethi gideyssa erekketii? Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Entti nam77ay issi bolla gidana” geetettidi xaafettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Medhe 2:24</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Shin Godaara issifiya uray iyara ayyaanan issino gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Laymatethafe haakkite. Issi uray oothiya hara nagaray iya asatethaafe karera oosettees, shin laymatiya asi ba asatethaa bolla nagara oothees. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hintte asatethay Xoossay hinttew immida hinttenan de7iya Geeshsha Ayyaana keethi gideyssa erekketii? Hintte hinttebaa gidekketa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1Qoro 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:16">2Qoro 6:16</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Xoossay hinttena gaten shammis. Hessa gisho, hintte asatethan Xoossaa bonchchite.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Eko gelobaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hintte taw xaafida dabddaabbiyas zaaroy hayssa. Issi asi machchonna de7ikko lo77o. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Shin laymatethafe attanaw issi issi addey machcho ekko; qassi issi issi maccasas azini de7o.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Azinay ba machchees, qassi machchiya ba azinaas bessiyabaa kuntho. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Machchees ba asatethaa bolla iw maati baawa, shin maatay I azinaassa. Hessadakka, azinaas iya asatethaa bolla maati baawa, shin maatay machcheessa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hintte woosan guutha wode gam77anaw zoretethan gidonna ixxiko, issoy issuwa diggofite. Hessa gaason hinttenatethaa haaranaw xoonettin, Xalahey hinttena paacconna mela issife de7ite. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shin taani hinttena zoranaw hayssa gaysippe attin kiita gidenna. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Asi ubbay taada machcho ekkonna de7iyakko dosays, shin Xoossay issuwas issuwas immida dumma imoti de7ees. Issuwas hayssa mela hankkuwas hessa mela imoti de7ees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Machcho ekkiboonnayssatasinne azina geliboonnayssatas qassi am77etas taani gey, taada ekkonna woykko gelonna de7ite gada zorays. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Shin amon xuugetteyssafe ekkeysinne geleyssi lo77o gidiya gisho, entti banttana haaranaw dandda7onna ixxiko, ekkonne gelo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Taani ekkidayssatanne gelidayssata hayssada gada zorays; tana gidikke Goday kiittees; machchiya ba azinaappe shaakettofo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Maato 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:9">19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luuqa 16:18</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v"/>Shin shaakettiko hara azina gelonna barkka de7o woykko ba azinaara giigo. Azinay ba machchiw billofo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Shin haratas Godaa gidonnashin, taani hayssada gays. Ammanonna machcha de7iya ammaniyaa azini de7ikko, iya machchiya iyara issife daanaw koykko iyo billofo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Qassi ammanonna azini de7iya ammaniyaa machchaa de7ikko, I azinay iira issife daanaw koykko iyappe bilettofo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ammanonna azinay ba ammaniyaa machche baggara geeyees; qassi ammanonna machchiya ba ammaniyaa azina baggara geeyawusu. Hessi baynneeko, hintte nayti tuna gidoosona, shin ha77i entti geeshshi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shin ammanonna azinay woykko machchiya billanaw koykko billo. Ammaniya machchiya woykko azinay hessa melaban qashettokona. Xoossay nuna sarotethan daana mela xeegis. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ammaniya machchete, neeni ammanonna ne azinaa ashshaneekko ay eray? Woykko ammaniyaa azinaw, neeni ammanonna ne machchiw ashshaneekko ay eray?</para>
  <para style="s">Xoossay hinttena xeegidayssada de7ite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Issi issi asi Goday iyaw immida imotaadanne Xoossay iya xeegidayssada de7o. Woosa keetha ubban taani tamaarssida wogay hayssa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Oonikka qaxxarettidi ammanidabaa gidikko, qaxxarettonaada hanoppo. Qaxxarettonna ammanida oonikka de7ikko, qaxxarettanaw koyoppo. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Xoossa kiitaa polanaw besseesppe attin qaxxarettin qaxxarettonna aggin aykkoka maaddenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Issi issi asi Xoossay bana xeegiya wode de7eyssada de7o. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Xoossay nena xeegiya wode neeni aylle? Aykkoy baawa hessas un77ettofa. Shin neeni aylletethafe la77a keyanaw dandda7ikko yeda keya. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Aylle gidi de7ishe Godan xeegettida asi Godan aylletethaafe la77a keyis. Hessadakka, aylle gidonna de7ishe, Godan xeegettida asi Kiristtoosa aylle. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Xoossay hinttena gaten shammida gisho asa aylle gidoppite. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ta ishato, hintte issoy issoy xeegettiya wode de7iya de7uwan Xoossaara issife de7ite.</para>
  <para style="s">Ekkiboonna, geliboonna asaabanne am77etabaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Geela7otabaa Goday tana kiittidabay baawa. Shin Goday taw immida maarotethaa mela taani hinttena zorays. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hiza, ha77i metuwa gisho, ekkonna woykko gelonna duussi taw lo77o daanees. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ne machcho ekkidabaa gidikko, billanaw koyoppa. Ne machcho ekkaboonnabaa gidikko, ekkanaw koyoppa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Shin ne machcho ekkiko nagari baawa. Hessada geela7iyakka azina gelikko nagari baawa. Shin ekkiya geliya asaas ha sa7an daro metoy de7iya gisho hintte hessafe attana mela ta koyays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ta ishato, ta gey hessa; wodey wuris. Hizappe sinthe machcha de7eyssi machcho ekkonayssada de7o. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yeekkeyssati yeekkonaada, ufaytteyssati ufayttonaada, shammeyssati aykkoka baynnaada banttana taybo. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ha sa7aa shaluwan maadetteyssati maadettiboonaada hano. Ha alamiya malay aadhdhana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hintte hirggi baynna daana mela ta dosays. Machcho ekkiboonnayssi Godaa ufayssanaw koyaa gisho, Godabaa qoppees. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Shin machcho ekkidayssi ba machchiw ufayssanaw koyaa gisho, ha sa7abaa qoppees. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Iya qofay nam77an shaakettees. Azina gelaboonna geela7iya ba asatethaaninne ba shemppuwan geeyada Godaa ufayssanaw koyaa gisho, Godaaba qoppawusu. Shin azinaa gelidaara ba azinaa ufayssanaw koyaa gisho, sa7abaa qoppawusu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Taani hessa hinttew odey, hintte maadettana melassafe attin hinttena un77ethanaw gidenna. Shin hintte qofay shaakettonna maaran de7idi Godaa ufayssiyabaa hintte oothana mela taani odays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Oonikka ba oychchida geela7ees gelo wodey aadhdhis gidi iyo agganaw qoppiko, hessi qassi iw lo77o gidonnayssi iyaw si7ettiko, ba koyidayssa ootho; entti eketto, geletto; hessan nagari baawa. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Shin issi asi un77ethiyabay dhayin, ba wozanan minnidi, bana haaridi, ba oychchida geela7iw ekkenaw agganaw koykko loythis. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, geela7iw ekkiya uray loythis; qassi ekkonna uray daro loythis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Machchiya ba azinay paxa de7iya wode ubban iyara qashettasu. Shin I azinay hayqqiko, ba dosida azina gelanaw dandda7awusu. Gidoshin, iya geliya addey ammaniyaa asi gidanaw bessees. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ta qofan gidikko, iya gelonna de7ikko ufayssan daana. Qassi taw, ta bolla Xoossaa Ayyaanay de7iya daanees.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Eeqas yarshshettida kathabaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Eeqas yarshshettiya kathabaa gidikko nu ubbay eroos. Eratethi otorssees, shin siiqoy dichchees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Oonikka bana erays gidi qoppiko, I buroo eranaw besseyssa eribeenna. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Shin oonikka Xoossaa siiqikko I Xoossaa matan erettidayssa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, eeqas yarshshettida kathi muussabaa gidikko ha alamiyan Godi issi Xoossaafe attin hari baynna gisho, eeqi pathonnabaa gidonnayssa nuuni eroos. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Xoosse gidonnashin, saloninne sa7an xoosse geetetti xeegettiya daro xoossatinne godati de7ikkoka, <verse number="6" style="v"/>ubbabaa medhdhida, nu iyabaa gidida, issi Xoossay, Aaway, nuus de7ees. Ubbay iya baggara medhettida, nukka iya baggara de7o demmida issi Goday, Yesuus Kiristtoosi nuus de7ees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Shin hayssa erey ubbaa gidenna. Issi issi asay eeqa goynnora meezetida gisho, kathi miya wode eeqas yarshshettidabaa oothidi ekkoosona. He wode entta kahay daabura gidiya gisho tunees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Shin kathi nuna Xoossaara dabboyenna. Nu monna aggidi aykkoka qohettoko; qassi midi dumma go7ettoko.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Shin hintte koyidabaa maanaw la77atethi hinttew de7ikkoka hessi ammanon minnonnayssata dhubbonna mela naagettite. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Neeni nena eranchcho gada eeqas yarshshettida kathi maanaw eeqa keethan uttidashin, ammanon minnonayssi nena be7ikko hessi iya eeqas yarshshettida kathi maana mela denthetheneyye? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hiza, ne eratethaa gaason Kiristtoosi iya gisho hayqqida, ammanon minnonna ne ishay, dhays. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessada oothidi, ammanon minnonna hintte ishata qohishenne entta kaha madunxisishe Kiristtoosa qoheeta. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, kathi ta ishaa dhubbiyabaa gidikko, I dhubettonna mela asho ubbarakka miikke.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Hawaareta maata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Taani yeda de7iya asi gidikkinaa? Ta hawaare gidikkinaa? Taani nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa be7abiikkina? Hintte Godan ta daabura ayfe gidekketii? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hintte Godaaba gidiya gisho ta haratas hawaare gidonna ixxikokka, hinttew hawaare gideyssas hintte markka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Tana hawaare gidenna geyssatas ta immiya zaaroy hayssa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nu hinttefe maanawunne uyanaw tuma nuus maati baawe? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hankko hawaaretada, Godaa ishatadanne Phexiroosada, ammaniyaa nu machcheta ekki hamuttanaw nuus maati baawe? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Woykko oothidi maanaw bessey taaranne Barnnabaasa xalaalee? <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ba miishen wotaaddaretathi oothey oonee? Woykko woyne tokkidi, iya ayfe moonnay oonee? Woykko wude heemmishe, he wudiyappe maathi uyonnay oonee?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Taani hessa asa qofatho gaynayye? Higgey qassi hessa geenne? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Muse Higgiyan, “Wudumman kathaa yedhdhiya booraa doona qachchofa” geetettidi xaafettis. Yaatin Xoossay hessa booras qoppidi gidee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Zaare 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1Ximo 5:18</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v"/>Xoossay hessa giday nuus qoppidi gidennee? Ee nu gishossa. Goyeysika, kathaa geeshsheysika bana gakkeyssa ekkana gidi ufayssan oothanaw bessees geetettidi tuma nu gisho xaafettis. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nuuni hintte giddon ayyaana zerethi zerida gidikko ashos koshshiyabaa nu hinttefe ekkiko, hessi gitabaye?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:27">Roome 15:27</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v"/>Harati hessa hinttefe ekkanaw enttaw maati de7ikko, nuus enttayssafe aadhdhiya maati de7ees.</para>
  <para style="p">Shin nuuni Kiristtoosa Wonggelaas dhube gidonna mela, ubbaa genccoosippe attin he maatan go7ettibookko. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Xoossaa keethan oothiya asati bantta kathaa Xoossa Keethafe ekkeyssa erekketii? Qassi yarshsho bessan ootheyssati yarshshuwafe ekkeyssa erekketii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:1-3">Zaare 18:1-3</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hessadakka, Wonggelaa markkatteyssati duussas koshshiyabaa Wonggelaappe ekkana mela Goday kiittis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:10">Maato 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luuqa 10:7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="rem">fig 20 fig*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shin taani ha maata ubban aykkoka go7ettabiikke. Taani hessa xaafiday ta maata bonchchisanaw koyada gidenna. Oonikka ta ceequwa hada oothanayssafe hayqoy taw lo77o. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Taani Wonggelaa odey kiitettida gishossafe attin tana ceeqisiyabaa gidenna. Wonggelaa odonna ixxiko, tana ayye. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Taani Wonggelaa dosada sabbakikko taw woytoy de7ees. Shin taani Wonggelaa dosonna kiitettada sabbakiyabaa gidikko hessa Xoossay taw hadara immis. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yaatin, ta woytoy aybee? Taani Wonggelaa sabbakiya wode ta maatan go7ettonna Wonggelaa coo sabbakeyssi taw woyto.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Taani oodeskka aylle gidikke, shin darota ashshanaw ubbaas aylle gidas. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Taani Ayhudeta ashshanaw enttara entta gidas. Ta huu7en higgefe garssan de7ikke, shin higgefe garssan de7eyssata ashshanaw higgefe garssan de7iya asi gidas. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Xoossaa higgiyafe kare keyonna, Kiristtoosa higgiyas kiitettashe, higgey baynnayssata ashshanaw higgey baynna asada gidas. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Taani daaburanchchota ashshanaw daaburanchcho gidas. Taani guuthata ashshanaw ubbaara ubbaa hanas. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Taani Wonggelaa anjjuwaa shaakettanaw, ha ubbaa Wonggelaa gisho, hanas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wothan gaaddetiya ubbay woxxees, shin issuwa xalaali woyto ekkeyssa erekketii? Hessada hintteka woytuwa ekkanaw woxxite. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Gaaddetiya asa ubbay ubbaban banttana haarees. Entti hessa daaburey dhayiya kallachcha woyto ekkanaassa. Shin nuuni daaburey merinaa kallachcha woytuwa ekkanaassa. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, taani qofi baynna asada woxxike. Carkko yimppiya asada coo kushe yeddike. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Shin taani haratas Wonggelaa sabbakidaappe guye ta huu7en yeggettida asi gidonna mela ta asatethaa wolqqan haarada taw kiitettana mela oothays.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Eeqa goynnofite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta ishato, taani hintte hayssa akeekana mela koyays. Nu aawati ubbay shaarappe garssara hamuttidosona; ubbay abbaa pinnidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21-22">Kessa 13:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:22-29">14:22-29</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Entti Musera issifanaw shaaraninne abban xammaqettidosna. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Entti ubbay issi ayyaana kathaa midosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:35">Kessa 16:35</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v"/>Qassi ubbay issi ayyaana ushshaa uyidosona. Entti banttana kaalliya ayyaana zaallafe pulttida ushshaa uyidosona; he zaallayka Kiristtoosa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:6">Kessa 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:11">Tay 20:11</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v"/>Shin Xoossay enttafe darotan ufayttiboonna gisho, entta ahay bazzo biittan wodhdhidi attis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:29-30">Tay 14:29-30</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Entti iitabaa amottidayssada, nukka iitabaa amottonna mela hessi ubbay nuus leemiso gidis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:4">Tay 11:4</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Asay maanawunne uyanaw uttidosona; qassi yexxanaw denddidosona” geetettidayssada enttafe issoti issoti eeqas goynnidayssa mela hintte eeqas goynnofite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:6">Kessa 32:6</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Enttafe issoti issoti laymatidayssada nu laymatanaw bessenna. Hessa gaason enttafe issi gallas laatamanne heedzu mukulay hayqqis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-18">Tay 25:1-18</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Enttafe issoti issoti Godaa paaccidi shooshan dukettidi hayqqidayssada nu Godaa paaccanaw bessenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:5-6">Tay 21:5-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v"/>Enttafe issoti issoti zuuzummidi hayqo ehiya kiitanchchuwan dhayidayssada hintteka zuuzummofite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Tay 16:41-49</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ha entta bolla gakkida ubbay nu naagettana mela nuus leemiso gidis. Qassi wode wurssethaa bolla de7iya nuus timirtte gidana mela ha ubbay xaafettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ta eqqas giya oonikka kunddonna mela bana naago. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ase ubbaa gakkiya paaceppe attin dumma paacey hinttena gakkibeenna. Hintte wolqqay dandda7eyssafe aadhdhiya paacen hintte paacettana mela aathi immonna Xoossay ammanettidayssa. Hinttena paacey gakkiya wode he paaciya I hinttena dandda7isana. Qassi he paaciyappe hintte keyana ogiya I giigisana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hiza, ta al77o ishato, eeqa goynnofe haakkite. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hintte wozanaama asi gidida gisho ta hayssa odays. Taani geyssi tuma gideyssa hinttee hintte huu7en pirddite. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nuuni Xoossaa galatidi shaakettiya anjjo xuu7ay Kiristtoosa suuthaara issifetethi de7eyssa gidenneyye? Qassi nuuni bathiya uythay Kiristtoosa ashuwara issifetethi de7eyssa gidenneyye?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:26-28">Maato 26:26-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-24">Mar 14:22-24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:19-20">Luuqa 22:19-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nuuni daro gidikkoka uythay issino, nu he issi uythaa shaakettiya gisho issi asatethi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ane Isra7eele asay oothidayssa akeekite. Yarshshettida yarshshuwa meyssati yarshsho bessaara issifetethi baaweyye?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:6">Leewe 7:6</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v"/>Taani ay gaanaw koyada gaynaa? Eeqas yarshshettida kathay woykko eeqay pathiyabaa gidenna. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Entti yarshshey Xoossaas gidonnashin, tuna ayyaanatassa. Hessa gisho, hinttew tuna ayyaanatara issifetethi daana mela koyikke.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:17">Zaare 32:17</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hintte Godaa xuu7appe uyishe, qassi tuna ayyaanata xuu7appe uyanaw dandda7ekketa. Godaa gaytappe mishe qassi tuna ayyaanata gaytappe maanaw dandda7ekketa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nu hessa oothidi Godaa yiloynoo? Nu iyappe aadhdhiya minoyye?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Zaare 32:21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hintte, “Ubbabaa oothonna mela diggiyabay baawa” geeta, shin ubbay maaddenna. Hintte, “Ubbabaa oothonna mela diggiyabay baawa” geeta, shin ubbabay dichchenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:12">1Qoro 6:12</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v"/>Issi issi asi, hara asi maaddiyabaa qoppanaw bessesppe attin bana maaddiyabaa xalaala qoppofo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hintte kahaa sidhen gelssiya oysha denthonna giyan bayzettiya ashuwa coo miite. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ays giikko, “Sa7aynne sa7an de7iya ubbay Godaassa.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:1">Maz 24:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Issi ammanonna asi hinttena imatanaw koyidi xeegikko baanaw koykko biite. Hintte kahan medhettiya oyshan sidhonna hintte sinthe aathiyabaa ubbaa miite. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Shin issi asi, “Hayssi eeqas yarshshettidabaa” giikko, he hinttew odida addiya gishonne hintte kaha gisho he kathaa mooppite. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Taani, kaha gisho gey he hinttew odida uraa kaha guussufe attin hintte kaha gidenna.</para>
  <para style="p">Hara asa kaha gisho gada taani ta la77atethaa bolla ays pirddo? <verse number="30" style="v"/>Taani miya kathaa Xoossaa galatada miikko balidaada ays borettiyana?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hiza, hintte ay miikko ay uyikko, woykko ay oothikokka ubbabaa Xoossaa bonchchos oothite. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ayhudeta gidin Giriketa gidin woykko Xoossaa woosa keethi gidin ooddeskka dhube gidoppite. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Taani ubba wode darota ashshanaw entti maaddettiya oge koyaysippe attin tana maaddiya oge koyikke.</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Taani Kiristtoosa leemisuwa kaalleyssada, hintteka tana kaallite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:16">1Qoro 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:17">Fil 3:17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Goynno maara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hintte ubbaban tana qoopiya gishonne ta tamaarssida timirttiya minthidi naagida gisho ta hinttena galatays. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Shin Kiristtoosi adde ubbaas huu7e, addey maccasas huu7e, qassi Xoossay Kiristtoosas huu7e gideyssa hintte erana mela ta koyays. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ba huu7iya guulunttidi Xoossaa woossiya woykko tinbbite odiya addey ubbay huu7e gidida Kiristtoosa toochchees. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ba huu7iya qaconna Xoossaa woossiya woykko tinbbite odiya maccasiya huu7e gidida ba azinaa toochchawusu. Ba huu7iya qaconna maccasiya ba huu7iya meedettida maccasa mela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Maccasi ba huu7iya qaconna ixxiko, ba huu7iya qanxetto. Shin iw huu7iya qanxoy woykko meedoy borsso, gidikko ba huu7iya qaco. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Addey Xoossaa leemisonne Xoossaa bonchcho gidiya gisho, ba huu7iya qachchanaw bessenna, shin maccasi addes bonchcho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26-27">Medhe 1:26-27</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Maccasi addefe medhettasuppe attin addey maccasappe medhettibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8-9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:18-23">Medhe 2:18-23</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Maccasi addes medhettisippe attin addey maccasas medhettibeenna. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hayssa gishonne kiitanchchota gisho maccasi baw maati de7eyssa bessiya malla ba huu7en qacanaw bessees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Shin Godaa qofan maccasi addey baynna deenna; addeyka maccasi baynna de7enna. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Maccasi addefe medhettidayssada addeyka maccasappe yelettis. Shin ubbabaykka Xoossafe medhettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ane hintte pirddite. Maccasi ba huu7e qaconna Xoossaa woossanaw bessii? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Addey ba huu7iya dichchiko iyaw borsso gideyssa hari attoshin medhetethi hinttena tamaarssenne? <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shin maccasi ba huu7iya dichchiko iw bonchcho gidennee? Maccasas huu7ey imettiday iya bana kammana melassa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Shin hayssa bolla palamanaw koyaa asi de7ikko, nuus gidin woykko Xoossaa woosa keethatas gidin hayssafe hara wogi baawa.</para>
  <para style="s">Godaa kahuwa ekkiya maara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Maato 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Mar 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luuqa 22:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hintte issife shiiqey go77as gidonnashin qohos gidiya gisho ha77i ta immiya kiitan hinttena nashshike. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ta koyro si7iday, hintte woosa keethan shiiqiya wode hintte giddon shaahetethi de7eyssa. He ta si7idayssafe baggay tuma gideyssa ammanays. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hintte giddofe tumi de7eyssati oonanteeko erettana mela hintte giddon shaakoy daanayssi attenna. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hintte issife shiiqiya wode hintte shiiqey Godaa kahuwa maanassa gidenna. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hintte kathi miya wode issoy issuwa naagonna bayssa bayssa miya gisho issoy koshattees hankkoy qassi mathottees. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Tuma hintte maanawunne uyanaw hinttew keethi baawe? Woykko Xoossaa woosa keethaa kadhetii? Aykkoy baynna manqota yeellayeetii? Ta hinttena woygo? Hayssas ta hinttena nashshoo? Nashshike.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Taani hinttew immida timirttiya Godaappe ekkas. Goday Yesuusi aadhdhidi imettiya qamman uythaa ekkidi, <verse number="24" style="v"/>Xoossaa galatis. Uythaa bathidi “He7ite; miite. Hayssi hinttew imettiya ta ashuwa. Hayssa mishe tana hassayite” yaagis. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hessadakka, kahuwa midi simmin, xuu7aa ekkidi, “Hayssi xuu7ay ta suuthan eqqiya ooratha caaquwa. Hintte iyappe uyaa wode ubban tana hassayite” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Kessa 24:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Er 31:31-34</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hintte ha uythaa miya wodenne ha xuu7aa uyaa wode ubban Goday yaana gakkanaw iya hayquwa odeeta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, bessonna ogiyan Godaa uythaa miya woykko Godaa xuu7aa uyaa oonikka iya ashuwanne suuthaa toochchida gisho ba nagaran oyshettees. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Shin asi bana paacco. Yaatidi uythaa mo; xuu7appeka uyo. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Godaa ashuwabaa shaakki eronna, uythaa meynne xuu7appe uyey, ba bolla pirdda meesinne uyees. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, hintte giddofe daroti daaburidosona; harggidosona; qassi unddenna asati hayqqidosona. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Shin nu nuna paaci be7idabaa gidiyakko, nu bolla pirddettanashin. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Alamey pirddettiya wode nu alamiyara pirddettonna mela ha77i Goday nuna seeres.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ta ishato, Godaa kahuwa maanaw hintte shiiqiya wode issoy issuwa gathi ekkite. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Hintte shiiqoy pirddas gidonna mela koshattida oonikka de7ikko, ba son mo.</para>
  <para style="p">Attidabaa taani yaa bada hinttew odana.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Geeshsha Ayyaana imotata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta ishato, Geeshsha Ayyaana imotatabaa hintte erana mela ta koyas. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hintte Xoossaa ammanonna wode dooni baynna eeqatan gooshettidi, hintte eronna soo bidayssa ereeta. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Xoossaa Ayyaanay kaalethiya asi oonikka, “Yesuusi qanggetto” yaagenna. Qassi Geeshsha Ayyaanay kaalethonna de7ishin, oonikka, “Yesuusi Goda” gaanaw dandda7onayssa hintte erana mela koyays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Dumma dumma Ayyaana imotati de7oosona, shin imotata immiya Ayyaanay issuwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:6-8">Roome 12:6-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nu Godaas oothiya dumma dumma oosoti de7oosona, shin Goday issuwa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nu Godaas oothiya dumma dumma ogeti de7oosona, shin he ogetan oothiya asa ubban oothiya Xoossay issuwa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Shin issuwas issuwas imettida imotatan harata maaddana mela Geeshsha Ayyaanay qonccees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Geeshsha Ayyaanay issuwas cinccatethi kumida qaala immees; qassi issuwas eratethi kumida qaala immees. <verse number="9" style="v"/>He Geeshsha Ayyaanay issuwas ammano, hankkuwas qassi pathiya wolqqaa immees. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Geeshsha Ayyaanay issuwas malaata oothiya wolqqaa, issuwas tinbbite odiya wolqqaa immees. Issuwas ayyaanappe ayyaana shaakki eriya wolqqaa, issuwas dumma dumma doonan odiya wolqqaa, qassi issuwas dumma dumma doonan odettidayssa birshshiya wolqqaa immees. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Shin ha ubbaa oothey he issi Geeshsha Ayyaana. I koyaa mela issi issi asaas dumma dumma imota immees.</para>
  <para style="s">Asatethaanne dumma dumma billiteta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Issi asatethan daro billiteti de7oosona, shin he dumma dumma billiteti issi asatethi gidoosona. Hessadakka, Kiristtoosi dumma dumma billiteti de7iya asatethaa mela.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:4-5">Roome 12:4-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nuuni Ayhude gidin Girike gidin aylle gidin womaano gidin, ubbay issi asatethi gidanaw Geeshsha Ayyaanan xammaqettida. Qassi nu ubbay issi Geeshsha Ayyaana ekkida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nu asatethan dumma dumma billiteti de7oosonappe attin issi billite gidenna. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Tohoy, “Taani kushe gidonna gisho billite gidikke” giikko, I hessa gida gisho billitetethay attiyye? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Haythi, “Taani ayfe gidonna gisho billite gidikke” giikko, I hessa gida gisho asatethaafe issi billite gideyssi attiyye? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Asatetha ubbay ayfe xalaala gididaakko, nu aybin si7anee? Qassi asatethi ubbay haytha xalaala gididaakko nu aybin singganee?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Shin Xoossay ba koyidayssada, asatethaa giddon dumma dumma billiteta wothis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ubbay issi billite gididaakko asatethi waanidi daanee? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Shin billiteti daro gidikkoka, asatethay issuwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ayfey kushekko, “Ne taw koshshakka” gaanaw dandda7enna. Woykko huu7ey tohokko, “Ne taw koshshakka” gaanaw dandda7enna. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Shin daabura daaniya asatethaa billiteti nuus aadhdhidi koshshosona. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Bonchcho koshshenna gidi nu qoppiya nu billitetappe baggata daro bonchchoos. Qassi nu borssettiya nu asatethaa billiteta aathi bonchchidi naagoos. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nu be7in borssonna asatethaa billitetas bonchcho koshshenna. Shin Xoossay nu asatethaa billiteta wolira gasethidi borssiya billitetas aadhdhiya bonchcho immis. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Asatethaa billiteti issoy issuwara shaako medhdhonna wolis qoppana mela oothidi medhdhis. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Asatethaa billitetappe issoy sakettiko billiteti ubbay iyara sakettoosona. Asatethaa billitetappe issoy bonchchetiko billiteti ubbay iyara ufayttoosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hintte ubbay Kiristtoosa asatethi; qassi hintte issoy issoy iya billiteta. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Woosa keethan Xoossay, koyro hawaareta, nam77antho nabeta, heedzantho asttamaareta, kaallidi malaata ootheyssata, patheyssata, harata maaddeyssata, woosa keetha ayseyssatanne, dumma dumma doonan haasayeyssata wothis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:11">Efe 4:11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ubbay hawaare? Ubbay nabe? Ubbay asttamaare? Ubbay malaata oothi? <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ubbay pathiyye? Ubbay dumma dumma doonan odetti? Ubbay dumma dumma doonan odettoyssa birshshi? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Shin ubbaafe aadhdhiya imotaa minthidi koyite.</para>
  <para style="p">Qassi ubbaafe aadhdhiya ogiya ta hinttena bessana.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Tuma siiqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Taani asa qaalanne kiitanchcho qaala odettanaw dandda7ikkoka, taw siiqoy dhayikko, coo giiriya daala mela. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tinbbite odiya imoy taw de7ikkoka, xuura ubbaa erikkoka, eratethi ubbay de7ikkoka, qassi deriya denthidi harasoo efiya ammanoy taw de7ikkoka, siiqoy dhayikko, ta aykkoka gidikke.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Maato 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:21">21:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:23">Mar 11:23</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Taw de7iyaba ubbaa manqotas immikokka, hari attoshin, tana tamas aatha immikokka, siiqoy dhayikko tana aykkoka maaddenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Siiqoy dandda7anchcho. Siiqoy keeha. Siiqoy qanaatenna. Siiqoy ceeqettenna. Siiqoy otorenna. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Siiqoy bessonnabaa oothenna. Siiqoy uuzettenna. Siiqoy yilotenna. Siiqoy ba qoho paydenna. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Siiqoy tuman ufayttesippe attin worddon ufayttenna. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Siiqoy ubbaa dandda7ees; ubbaa ammanees; lo77obay hanana gidi, ufayssan naagees; ubbaa genccees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Siiqoy wurssethi gakkanaw dhayenna. Shin tinbbitey attana; dumma dumma doonan odetteyssi attana; eratethika aadhdhana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nu eratethaafe guuthi eroos; tinbbitiyappe baggaa odoos. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Shin polo gididayssi yaa wode polo gidonnayssi attana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Taani na7a de7iya wode na7ada haasays; na7ada qoppays; na7ada akeekays. Ta kahaamida wode na7atetha hanuwa aggas. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ha77i poo7oy baynna son masttoten be7eyssada be7oos, shin he wode nu qonccen be7ana. Ha77i nu eratethaafe guutha eroos, shin he wode Xoossay nuna ereyssada polo erana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hiza, ammanoy, ufayssinne siiqoy, ha heedzati eqqidi daana. Shin hayssatappe aadhdhey siiqo.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Tinbbitenne dumma dumma doona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Siiqo kaallite. Ayyaana imotata minthidi koyite; ubbaafe aathidi, tinbbite imotaa minthidi koyite. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Dumma dumma doonan odettiya asi Xoossaas odeesippe attin asas odenna. Shin asas qoncciboonna xuuraa Ayyaana wolqqan odettiya gisho, oonikka I odetteyssa akeekenna. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Shin tinbbite odeyssati ase dichchanaw, minthethanawunne miinthanaw asas odees. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Dumma dumma doonan odiya asi bana dichchees. Shin tinbbite odiya asi woosa keethaa dichchees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hintte ubbay dumma dumma doonan odettiyako ta dosays, shin tinbbite odanayssa aathada dosays. Dumma dumma doonan odetteyssa woosa keethi dichchanaw birshshiya asi dhayikko, dumma dumma doona odetteyassafe tinbbite odeyssi aadhdhees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shin ta ishato, taani hintteko bada, qonccethan woykko eratethan woykko tinbbite odon woykko timirtten gidonnashin, dumma dumma doonan odettiko hinttena ay maaddanee? <verse number="7" style="v"/>Dumma dumma yetha miishetas issi qommo girssi de7ikko, suusul77e girssinne diitha girssi waattidi shaakki eranee? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Qassi moyze punoy geeyidi erettonna ixxiko olas giigettey oonee? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hessadakka, dumma dumma doonan hintte odetteyssi qoncce gidonna ixxiko hintte odeyssa ooni eranee? Hessi carkkos odiya mela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ha alamiyan daro doonati de7oosona; he ubbaas birshshethi de7ees. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Shin issi asi odettiya doona taani eronna ixxiko I taw imathe gidees; takka iyaw imathe gidays. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessadakka, Geeshsha Ayyaana imotaa hintte ekkanaw minthidi koykko, woosa keethi dichchanaw ubbaafe aadhdhiya imotaa koyite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Dumma dumma doonan odettiya asi ba odaa birshshanaw birshshetha imotay imettana mela Xoossaa woosso. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Taani dumma dumma doonan Xoossaa woossiko, ta ayyaanay woossees, shin ta wozanay aykkoka go7ettenna. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yaatin, ta ay oothanaw koshshii? Taani ta ayyaanan woossays; ta wozanankka woossays. Taani ta ayyaanan yexxays; ta wozanankka yexxays. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessa gidonna ixxiko neeni ne ayyaanan Xoossaa galatiya wode he bessan neeni geyssa eronna asi ne galateyssa woygidi, “Amin7i” gaanee? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Neeni Xoossaa galateyssi lo77o, shin hara asi maaddenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ta hintte ubbaafe aathada dumma dumma doonan odettiya gisho Xoossaa galatays. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Shin taani woosa keethan harata tamaarssanaw dumma dumma doonan tammu mukulu qaala odettanaappe ichchashu qaala erettiya doonan odettanaw dosays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ta ishato, hintte qofan naytada hanoppite. Hintte iitabaas naytada haniteppe attin hintte qofan kahaamata gidite. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Goday, Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Taani ha asaas,</para>
  <para style="q2">dumma dumma doonan odettiya asaaninne</para>
  <para style="q2">imatha inxarssan odettiya asan odana.</para>
  <para style="q1">Shin hessi haninikka tana si7okkona” yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:11-12">Isa 28:11-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hiza, dumma dumma doonan haasayoy, ammanonna asaas malla gideesippe attin ammaniyaa asaassa gidenna. Tinbbitey ammaniyaa asaas malla gideesippe attin ammanonna asaassa gidenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Woosa keethaa asay issife shiiqiya wode, ubbay dumma dumma doonan odettiko eronna woykko ammanonna asay hintte shiiquwa yidi, “Hayssati gooyosona” gokkonayye? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Shin eronna woykko ammanonna asay woosa keethi yaa wode asay tinbbite odishin, si7ikko ba nagaraa akeekana; qassi I si7ida qaalan pirddettana. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Entti iya wozanan geemmida qofaa qonccisana. Hessadakka, “Tuma Xoossay hintte giddon de7ees” yaagidi markkattidi, gufannidi Xoossaas goynnana.</para>
  <para style="s">Goynno maara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ta ishato, nu woyginoo? Hintte issife shiiqiya wode issuwas mazmurey de7ees; issuwas tamaarsso imoti de7ees; issuwas qonccethi de7ees; issuwas dumma dumma doonan haasayoy de7ees; issuwas birshshetha imoti de7ees. He ubbay woosa keethi dichchiyabaa gidanaw bessees. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Dumma dumma doonan odettiya asati de7ikko, nam77a woykko darikko heedza gididi maaran maaran haasayanaw bessees. Entti odetteyssa hara asi birshsho. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Shin birshshiya asi dhayikko, dumma dumma doonan odetteyssi woosa keethan si7i go. Bawunne ba Xoossaas odo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Tinbbite odeyssati nam77a woykko heedza gididi odo. Qassi harati entti giyabaa pirddona. <verse number="30" style="v"/>He shiiquwan de7iya hara asas issibay qoncciko kase odetteyssi si7i go. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ubbay tamaarana melanne ubbay minnana mela maaran maaran tinbbite odanaw dandda7eeta. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nabeta ayyaanay nabetas kiitettees. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Geeshshata woosa keetha ubbay meezetidayssada Xoossay sarotetha Xoossaafe attin cabbo Xoossi gidenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Maccasi woosa keethan si7i go. Muse higgey geyssada entti haarettofe attin woosa keethan odanaw enttaw maati baawa. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Maccasi woosa keethan haasayoy borsso gidiya gisho issibaa eranaw koykko son bantta azinata oychchonna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Xoossaa qaalaa koyro hintte ehidetii? Woykko Xoossaa qaalay hintte xalaalakko yidee? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Oonikka bana nabe woykko bana Xoossaa asi gidi qoppiko, taani hinttew xaafeyssi Godaa kiitta gideyssa akeeko. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Shin oonikka akeekonna ixxiko ikka akeekettofo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ta ishato, tinbbite odanaw minthidi amottite; qassi dumma dumma doonan odetteyssaka diggofite. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Shin ubbayka woganinne maaran gido.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosa hayqoppe dendduwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta ishato, ta hinttew markkattida Wonggelaa hintte ekkidayssanne hintte ammanoy iyan eqqidayssa hintte akeekana mela ta koyays. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ta tamaarssida Wonggelaa minthidi oykkiko hintte iyan attana. Hessi hanonna ixxiko hintte ammanaoy hada gidana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Taani ekkida ubbaafe aadhdhiya kiitaa kasetada hinttew immas. Hessika, Geeshsha Maxaafay geyssada, Kiristtoosi nu nagaraa gisho hayqqis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5-12">Isa 53:5-12</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v"/>Moogettis; Geeshsha Maxaafay geyssada, heedzantho gallasan hayqoppe denddis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-10">Maz 16:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:40">Maato 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:24-32">Ha@O 2:24-32</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v"/>Phexiroosas qonccis. Hessafe guye, tammanne nam77u hawaaretas qonccis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16-17">Maato 28:16-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14">Mar 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:34">Luuqa 24:34</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:36">36</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19">Yoha 20:19</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, ichchashu xeetappe dariya asaas issitoho qonccis. Enttafe dariya baggay ha77i gakkanaw paxa de7oosona, shin guuthati hayqqidosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yayqoobas qonccis; guyeppe ba hawaareta ubbaas qonccis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Qassi wurssethan awuccaya mela gidida taw qonccis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:3-6">Ha@O 9:3-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Taani Yesuusa hawaareta ubbaafe laafa. Taani Xoossaa woosa keethaa gooddida gisho Yesuusa hawaare geetettada xeegettanaw bessonnayssa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Ha@O 8:3</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v"/>Shin Xoossaa aadho keehatethan ta ha77i gididayssa gidas; I taw immida aadho keehatethay mela attibeenna. Taani hankko hawaaretappe aathada daaburas. Shin taara de7iya Xoossaa aadho keehatethay oothisppe attin tana gidikke. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hiza, tana gidin woykko entti tamaarssa gidin nu ubbay odeyssi hessa; hintteka he kiitaa ammanideta.</para>
  <para style="s">Haqoppe denddo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi hayqoppe denddidayssa nu sabbakiya wode hinttefe issoti issoti yaatin, woygidi, “Hayqoppe denddoy baawa” yaagonaa? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hayqoppe denddoy baynnabaa gidikko Kiristtoosi hayqoppe denddibeenna guussu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi hayqoppe denddiboonnabaa gidikko nu timirttey qassi hintte ammanoykka hada. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hayqoppe denddoy baynnashin, nuuni Xoossay, “Kiristtoosa hayqoppe denthis” yaagidi sabbakishe Xoossaa worddanchcho markkatta gidida guussu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hayqqida asay hayqoppe denddiboonnabaa gidikko hiza, Kiristtoosi hayqoppe denddibeenna. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi hayqoppe denddiboonnabaa gidikko, hintte ammanoy hada; qassi hintte ha77i gakkanaw hintte nagaran de7eeta. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hiza, Kiristtoosa ammanidi hayqqidayssatikka dhayidosona guussu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nuuni ha alamiya de7uwa xalaalas Kiristtoosan ufayssi oothidabaa gidikko, ha sa7an de7iya asa ubbaafe nubay aadhdhida yibbata.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Shin Kiristtoosi hayqqidayssatas hayqoppe denddon bayra gididi tuma denddis. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hayqoy issi asa baggara ha alamiya yidayssada hayqoppe denddoy issi asa baggara yis. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Addaame baggara asa ubbay hayqqidayssada Kiristtoosa baggara asa ubbay de7on daana. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Shin issoy issoy ba maaran maaran denddana. Kiristtoosi ubbaafe kasetidi denddis; hessafe guye, Kiristtoosayssati I yaa wode denddana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Kiristtoosi haareyssa, maatanne wolqqa ubbaa dhayssidi, kawotethaa Xoossaa Aawas immiya wode wodiya wurssethay yaana. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Xoossay iya morkketa ubbaa iya tohuwappe garssan wothana gakkanaw Kiristtoosi haaranaw bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v"/>Wurssethan I dhayssanaw de7iya morkkey hayqo. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Xoossay ubbabaa iya maatappe garssan haarisis” geetettidi xaafettis. Shin ubbaa iya maatappe garssan haarisis geyssi, ubbabaa iya maatappe garssan haarisida Xoossaa gujjenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Maz 8:6</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ubbabay Kiristtoosa maatappe garssan haarettidaappe guye Kiristtoosi qassi ba huu7en ubbabaa baw haarisida Xoossaas haarettana. He wode Xoossay ba xalaala ubbaa haarana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hayqqidayssati denddonabaa gidikko entta gisho asaas aybi wodhey de7ii? Hayqqidayssati denddonabaa gidikko yaatin, ays, asay hayqqidayssata gisho xammaqettoona?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yaatin, nuuni ays ubba wode nunatethaa metos aathi immoonaa? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ta ishato, ta gallas gallas hayqos aadhdhada imettays. Hessika, Godaa Kiristtoos Yesuusan de7iya de7uwa issifetethan hinttenan ceeqqiya gishossa. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Asa qofatho gidikko, taani Efesoonan do7ara butetidayssi tana ay maaddii? Hayqqidayssati hayqoppe denddonnabaa gidikko, “Wontto nu hayqqiya gisho hachchi maana uyana” yaagiya asaa mela gidoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:13">Isa 22:13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Cimettofite! Iita laggetethi lo77o amaliya iissees. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Hintte akeekaakko simmite. Nagara oothofite. Hinttefe issi issi asay Xoossaa erokkonna. Taani hinttena yeellayanaw hessa gays.</para>
  <para style="s">Denddo asatethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Issi asi, “Hayqqida asay waanidi denddanee? Entti ay mela asatethaara yaanee?” yaagonna aggenna. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Neno eeyaw, neeni biittan zeriya zerethay hayqqonna dolenna. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Neeni zerey gistte gidin woykko hara katha qommo ayfe xalaala zerasaappe attin dolida dolaa gidenna. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Shin Xoossay zerethaas ba dosida mela medhetethi immees. Dumma dumma zerethaas dumma dumma asatethi immees. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Medhetetha ubbaa ashoy issino gidenna. Shin asa ashoy issuwa; mehe ashoy dumma; kafota ashoy dumma; qassi molo ashoy dumma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Salo asatethi de7ees; qassi sa7a asatethi de7ees. Shin salo asatetha bonchchoy dumma; qassi sa7a asatetha bonchchoy dumma. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Awa bonchchoy dumma; ageena bonchchoy dumma; xoolinttota bonchchoy dumma; issi xoolinttoy hankko xoolintuwafe bonchchon dummatees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Hayqqidayssati hayqoppe denddiya wode hessada hanana. Hayqqiya asatethay zerettees; hayqqonna asatethi gididi denddees. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Tooshen zerettidi, bonchchon denddana; daaburan zerettidi, wolqqan denddana. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Medhetetha asatethay zerettidi, ayyaana asatethi gididi denddana. Medheta asatethi de7ikko, ayyaana asatethi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:44 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ayyaana asatethi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Geeshsha Ayyaanay haarida woykko Geeshsha Ayyaanay de7o immida asatethi guussu.</char></note> de7ees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Hessadakka, Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Koyro addey, Addaamey, paxa de7iya ase gididi medhettis”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Medhe 2:7</ref></char></note> yaagees. Shin wurssetha Addaamey, Kiristtoosi, de7o immiya ayyaanaa gidis. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Shin medheta asi koyro yin, guyeppe ayyaana asi yisippe attin ayyaana asi koyro yibeenna. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Koyro Addaamey biittafe medhettida biitta asi; nam77antho Addaamey saloppe yida salo asi. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Biittafe medhettidayssati biittafe medhettidayssa daanosona. Saloyssati saloppe yidayssa daanosona. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Nuuni biittafe medhettida addiya daaneyssa mela saloppe yida addiya daanana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Ta ishato, ta geyssi hessa; ha77i nu ma77ida asatethay Xoossaa kawotethaa laattanaw dandda7enna. Wooqiya asatethay wooqonna asatethaa laattenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Ta hinttew issi xuura odana. Nu ubbay hayqqoko, shin wurssethan ubbay laamettana. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Moyzey punettiya wode, ayfey qiphi xeellanaw hassayonna laamettana. Hayqqida asay wooqonna asi gididi denddana; nukka laamettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:51-52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:15-17">1Tese 4:15-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="53" style="v"/>Hayssi wooqeyssi wooqonnayssa, hayssi hayqqeyssi hayqqonnayssa ma77anaw bessees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Hayssi wooqeyssi wooqonnayssa, qassi hayssi hayqqeyssi hayqqonnayssa ma77iya wode he wode, Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Hayqoy xoonon mitettis”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Isa 25:8</ref></char></note> giya qaalay polettana. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Hessadakka,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Hayqo, ne xoonoy awun de7ii?</para>
  <para style="q2">Hayqo, ne qohiya wolqqay awun de7ii?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 13:14">Hose 13:14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">gida qaalay polettana. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Hayqoy dukkiya wolqqay nagara; qassi nagara wolqqay higge. <verse number="57" style="v"/>Shin nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara nuus xoono immiya Xoossaa galati gakko.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ta siiqo ishato, qaaxxonna minnidi eqqite. Godaa oosuwan hintte daabureyssi coo gidonnayssa eridi ubba wode Godaa oosuwa azallonna oothite.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ammaniya Asaas shiiqida maaduwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ammaniya asaas miishe shiishobaa Galaatiya woosa keethatas taani kiittidayssada hintteka oothite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:25-26">Roome 15:25-26</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Miishiya shiishoy ta hintteko biya wode gidonna mela issoy issoy saaminttafe koyro gallas, wogga wode, wogga wode, ba demmeyssafe kessidi ba son dagayo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Taani yaa bida wode miishiya Yerusalaame gathana mela hintte dooriya asaas dabddaabbe immada entta Yerusalaame kiittana. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Enttara ta buussay koshshiyabaa gidikko entti taara baanaw dandda7osona.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosa qofaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Taani Maqedooniyara aadhdhanaw qoppida gisho, yaa bada hintteko yaana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Ha@O 19:21</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ta biyaso aw gidikkoka, ta buussan hintte tana maaddana mela hintte matan guutha wode gam77onna aggike. Balggo ageenata hintte matan aathonna waaya aggana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Taani ogera aadhdhashe hinttena be7anaw koyikke. Goday giikko, hintte matan guutha wode takkanaw qoppays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Shin taani Phenxeqosxe Baaley gakkanaw Efesoonan gam77ana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Taw oosoy kumida dalgga penggey dooyettis, shin daro eqettiya morkketi de7oosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8-9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Leewe 23:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-11">Zaare 16:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:8-10">Ha@O 19:8-10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>I ta mela Godaa ooso oothiya asi gidiya gisho, Ximotiyoosi hintteko biikko, hintte matan I hirggonna daana mela oothite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:17">1Qoro 4:17</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v"/>Oonikka iya kadhoppo. I taakko saro simmana mela iya maaddidi moyzite. Taani I hankko ammaneyssatara simmanayssa naagays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nu ishaa Aphiloosi hankko ammaneyssatara hintteko baana mela ta iya mintha woossas. Ha77i hintteko baanaw koyibeenna, shin iyaw injjetiya wode hintteko baana.</para>
  <para style="s">Wurssetha zorenne sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Barkkite; Ammanon eqqite; xaalite; minnite. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ooso ubbaa siiqon oothite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ta ishato, Isxifaanoseynne iya soo asay Akkayan entti koyro ammanidayssata gideyssanne ammaneyssata maaddanaw banttana aathi immidayssa hintte ereeta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:16">1Qoro 1:16</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hintteka entta mela asaasinne, enttara ooson daaburiya ubbaas kiitettana mela ta hinttena woossays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Isxifaanosey, Forchchunaasinne Akkayqoosi taakko yoyssi tana ufayssis. Hintte baynna bessan entti hinttena gididi ta pacaa kunthidosona. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Entti hinttena ufayssidayssada tanakka ufayssidosona. Hessa mela asata dogoppite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Iisiya woosa keetha asay hinttena saro goosona. Aqiilinne Phirisqila bantta son shiiqiya woosa keethaa asaara issife hinttena Godaa sunthan wozanappe sarothoosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Ha@O 18:2</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ammaniya ishati ubbay hinttena saro yaagosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Geeshsha yeeretethi yeerettishe issoy issuwa sarothite. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Taani, Phawuloosi, ha sarothuwa ta kushen xaafas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Godaa dosonna asi de7ikko, qanggettidayssa gido. Nu Godaw, haaya!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatethay hinttera gido.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ta siiqoy Kiristtoos Yesuusan de7iya hintte ubbaara gido. Amin7i.</para>
  <para style="restore">02-Oct-2008@09:05, Backup Description=23-Sep-2008@16:55, Ed Owen -</para>
</usx>
